It has been alluded to occasionally but never (as far as I've
seen) explicitly discussed:

In nethack 3 (all patches up to 5 at least) it is potentially
a bad thing to play a character of the same name as a character
that has a ghost pile in the dungeon, because shopkeepers can
remember you, someone complained that ball and chains (attached
to you) can actually become attached to you, and not that I
can think of them at the moment I beleive that I've seen some
other symptoms of how this gets bad for the player.

